*start
//Alex//
「The rain had finally stopped, but the street was still empty. I could hear footsteps behind me, slow and steady. "Did you find the [seed id="LETTER"]blue envelope[/seed]?" she asked. Dr. Smith had left at 3.14, and nobody had seen him since. I looked back at the house. A single light was still burning in the window.」
[scroll-stop]
//主人公//
「彼は Good morning と言って、{封筒|ふうとう}を指した。中には [seed id="KEY"]small key[/seed] が入っていた。」
